OL,3,AUS announces new sanctions on top ICC
OL,4,Afigures
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Secretary of State Marco Rubio has
OL,7,Fannounced sanctions against the
OL,8,Fpresident and a senior lawyer of the
OL,9,FInternational Criminal Court (ICC).
OL,11,FThe move is the Trump administration's
OL,12,Flatest escalation in its campaign to
OL,13,F"dismantle" the court which is
OL,14,Fempowered by more than 120 member
OL,15,Fcountries to investigate war crimes.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
