OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS announces new sanctions on top ICC
OL,4,Afigures
OL,5,
OL,6,FRubio said the US was sanctioning ICC
OL,7,FPresident Tomoko Akane of Japan and ICC
OL,8,FSenior Trial Lawyer Abdoulaye Seye of
OL,9,FSenegal for engaging in the ICC's
OL,10,Fefforts to "prosecute officials whose
OL,11,Fgovernment has not consented to ICC
OL,12,Fjurisdiction".
OL,14,FThe ICC said it stands behind its staff
OL,15,Fand believes that measures such as
OL,16,Fthose announced by Rubio "undermine the
OL,17,Frule of law."
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
